"af_bella|Good morning from Shanghai! We\u2019re standing on the Bund, the old stone riverfront. Those tall towers across the water are a business district called Lujiazui.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Good morning from Shanghai! We\u2019re standing on the Bund, the old stone riverfront. Those tall towers across the water are a business district called Lujiazui.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|Boston Harbor Hospital and Riverside Children\u2019s Hospital here are sister hospitals, which means their doctors work together. Twice a year they meet to talk through their hardest cases. Today you are the doctor from Boston.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Boston Harbor Hospital and Riverside Children\u2019s Hospital here are sister hospitals, which means their doctors work together. Twice a year they meet to talk through their hardest cases. Today you are the doctor from Boston.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|A five-year-old in Boston named Ellie has had a fever for five days. It might be a rare illness that the doctors here see far more often than we do.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|A five-year-old in Boston named Ellie has had a fever for five days. It might be a rare illness that the doctors here see far more often than we do.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|The doctors here wanted to go through the case with you in person. Also, Riverside treats this illness about fifteen times as often as Boston does.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
